{"sample_id": "demo_qa_001", "source_doc_ids": ["demo_rule_v1"], "source_chunk_ids": ["demo_rule_v1_article_2"], "question": "材料缺一项，能不能先开始审查？", "task_type": "condition", "answerable": true, "answer": "不能。按所给规则，补正完成前不开始审查。[S1]\n\n处理顺序是：先一次性告知需要补正的全部内容，待补正完成后再进入审查。因此，不能把“已告知补正”视作“已经补正完成”。[S1]\n\n这份材料没有规定补正期限，也未说明是否存在例外；仅凭当前材料无法进一步判断这两点。", "citations": ["S1"], "evidence": [{"source_key": "S1", "doc_id": "demo_rule_v1", "locator": "第二条", "quote": "补正完成前，不开始审查。", "start_char": 25, "end_char": 37, "content_sha256": "ca71ba7fd50afa2eea99c38d198ea4cd292d5c4295650e0ef1b21dd1ca397416"}], "teacher": {"model_id": null, "status": "handwritten_example"}, "verifier": {"status": "not_run"}, "checks": {"status": "fixture_only"}, "split": "example_only"}
